    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds a bit optimistic. I'm hearing from a lot of shop owners that these costs are actually going to force them to shut down or move overseas. Isn't it true that these mandates just place an unfair burden on small businesses compared to the big corporations who can afford the upgrades?",
